// [DRAFT] D307, D555, D564 — the manticore mercenary guards the end of the laboratory, drunk, and demands the cloak (BACKLOG 17).
say|LAB_BOSS|Hic! Another lizard out of the cells? Nobody paid me extra for you.
say|KUSAKAM|We just want to get out. I'm ready to bargain.
say|LAB_BOSS|Bargain? Nice cloak. Hand it over and maybe I'll look the other way.
say|KUSAKAM|This cloak belonged to my grandfather. I won't give it up.
say|LAB_BOSS|Then I'll take it off you myself. Same pay, more fun!
exit|
